        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Quand on voit un dracaena de taille adulte, on se dit que végéter lui a réussi.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Wenn sie völlig ausgewachsen sind, zeigt sich, wie sehr die Dracaena von all der Ruhe und Entspannung profitiert haben.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "Cuando los dracaenas alcanzan su tamaño adulto, queda patente que se han nutrido de tanto descanso y relajación.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "When they reach adult size, it's clear that the Dracaenas have really thrived on all that rest and relaxation.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Una volta raggiunte le dimensioni adulte, è chiaro che le dracaene si rinvigoriscono grazie a tutto il riposo e il relax.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        }
      },
      "id": "01HNJH5Y1FWWSPWJCBQ7ABXBNZ",
      "text": "When they reach adult size, it's clear that the Dracaenas have really thrived on all that rest and relaxation."
    }
  ],
